translate schinese_rewrite Dark_Forest_Map_86af9994:

    # "You enter the Chelforte Cavern..."
    "你进入切尔福特洞窟……"

translate schinese_rewrite Dark_Forest_Map_761d2b5f:

    # "You enter the Slumbrous Well..."
    "你进入沉眠之井……"

translate schinese_rewrite Dark_Forest_Map_5224c0f1:

    # "You enter the forest nightwatch..."
    "你进入森林夜哨……"

translate schinese_rewrite Dark_Forest_Map_789ba4d7:

    # "You enter the werewolves' den..."
    "你进入狼人巢穴……"

translate schinese_rewrite Dark_Forest_Map_633dca64:

    # "As you walk through the gap at the other end of the dungeon floor, you see Wuldon burst in through the treeline after you, making sure to keep you in his sights."
    "当你穿过地牢另一端的缺口时，你看见沃尔顿穿过树林冲了进来，紧跟在你身后，确保你始终在他的视线内。"

translate schinese_rewrite Dark_Forest_Map_7c9d8af2:

    # "You half expect him to join you in the next room, but he stops at the gap once again, poised to clear out any and all slimes trying to come after you."
    "你本以为他会跟你一起进入下一间房，但他再次停在缺口处，准备清理掉任何试图追上你的史莱姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Dark_Forest_Map_9369ba61:

    # "You enter the split trails..."
    "你进入分岔小径……"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_cebc3d91:

    # "You follow the trail marked out by Kari on your map."
    "你跟着地图上卡里所标的痕迹走。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_14d19a75:

    # "The winding forest path seems to lead to nowhere."
    "蜿蜒的森林小路似乎通向一片虚无。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_6b46014e:

    # "You look around and realize you are lost."
    "你环顾四周，意识到自己迷路了。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_a268f099:

    # "Suddenly, there's a rustling behind the leaves."
    "突然，树叶后传来一阵窸窸窣窣的声响。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_cce8d6f8:

    # "A grey werewolf jumps out as he points his paws at you."
    "一只灰色狼人跳了出来，伸出爪子指向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_a9b6294f:

    # ww "Die!"
    ww "死吧！"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_9118d4c1:

    # e "I just want to talk! Can you lead me to your leader?"
    e "我只是想聊聊！你能带我去见你们的首领吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_31191708:

    # ww "You tres-Passing on our terri-Tory!"
    ww "你擅——闯我们的领——地！"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_c18eb48e:

    # e "W-what?"
    e "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_c499d21d:

    # "Suddenly from an unknown corner, a pack of werewolves appears."
    "突然，一群狼人从不知名的角落里出现。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_58a9fa43:

    # "One of them leads in the front, he is much more brown than the usual grey in the werewolves."
    "其中一只走在最前面，比狼群中通常的灰色狼人棕色得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_e5e54a09:

    # "The leader is large and menacing. The other werewolves seem cowed in his presence."
    "首领高大而凶恶，其他狼人似乎在他面前噤若寒蝉。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_2737eaf0:

    # "The grey werewolf walks to stand behind the leader."
    "那只灰色狼人走到首领身后站定。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_124738dd:

    # u "What's the meaning of this, trespasser?"
    u "你来这里干什么，擅闯者？"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_06dc5143:

    # "There is a hint of warning in his tone."
    "他的语气中带着一丝警告。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_76ce4b30:

    # "You try to be as civil as possible. But with the pack of werewolves staring you down, escaping does not seem like a possibility."
    "你尽量表现得彬彬有礼。但一群狼人虎视眈眈地盯着你，逃跑似乎并不可能。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_e5bdb668:

    # e "I'm... [e]. I come from Lusterfield. What's your name?"
    e "我是[e] 来自乐斯民菲尔德 你叫什么名字?"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_cb780766:

    # "The alpha narrows his eyes at you like you're stupid."
    "首领眯起眼睛看着你，仿佛你是个蠢货。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_32b24e92:

    # u "I have no idea we're friends."
    u "我可不知道我们是朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_38ca0c19:

    # e "It'll make addressing you and finding you easier."
    e "这样称呼你、找到你都会更方便。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_12ce709a:

    # u "The name's Uffe, but you call me Alpha should the need arise."
    u "我叫乌菲，不过有需要时，你可以称我为首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_53ad3c4e:

    # u "Why are you here?"
    u "你为什么来这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_aad428a3:

    # e "I mean no harm. I'm here to inquire about something."
    e "我没有恶意。我来这里是想打听一件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_fdc6ad7b:

    # u "Is that so?"
    u "是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_8d78e781:

    # "The alpha says with mock interest."
    "首领故意装出感兴趣的样子说道。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_133fb6cc:

    # u "and why should we help you?"
    u "那我们为什么要帮你？"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_6f40020e:

    # e "To be kind?"
    e "为了友善？"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_3b567176:

    # "The alpha breaks into a sinister chuckle, which the other werewolves follow suit as well."
    "首领发出阴森的轻笑，其他狼人也跟着笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_94d9bf59:

    # u "You're funny. I'll give you that, trespasser."
    u "你真有趣。这点我承认，擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_4a71cbc0:

    # u "But I wonder if humor can save your life."
    u "不过，我很好奇幽默能不能救你的命。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_53be5a70:

    # "The werewolves close in around you."
    "狼人们向你逼近。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_81b11d62:

    # "In desperation, you pull out the magical stone."
    "走投无路之下，你掏出了那块魔法石。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_7d7f1f03:

    # e "I just want to know if you have seen this before?"
    e "我只是想知道，你以前见过这个吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_70e3b77d:

    # "The alpha raises his arm. The werewolves stop advancing."
    "首领抬起手臂，狼人们停止了前进。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_65b2d130:

    # u "Where did you get that, trespasser?"
    u "你从哪里弄到的，擅闯者？"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_d07f8004:

    # "You catches the sudden awareness in the alpha's eyes."
    "你捕捉到了首领眼中突然浮现的警觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_8d88816b:

    # e "So you do recognize this."
    e "看来你确实认得这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_1409c9b2:

    # u "So what if I do? You haven't answered my question, trespasser."
    u "那又怎样？你还没回答我的问题，擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_2b1066d1:

    # e "We found it outside the forest and a friend traced its magic back to this place."
    e "我们在森林外发现了它，我的一个朋友追溯它的魔力，最后找到了这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_53db15ad:

    # "The alpha narrows his eyes at you as if trying to see if you're lying or not."
    "首领眯起眼睛看着你，像是在判断你有没有撒谎。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_b6742205:

    # e "So... can you tell me more about this stone?"
    e "所以……你能告诉我更多关于这块石头的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_b8a34058:

    # u "I can."
    u "我可以。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_2810dfc8:

    # u "For a price."
    u "但要付出代价。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_5f487a00:

    # u "We'll let you stay here... only if you are willing to help our pack. Only afterwards, I will tell you what I know."
    u "我们可以让你留在这里……但前提是你愿意帮助我们的族群。等你帮完之后，我才会告诉你我知道的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_10280746:

    # e "O-ok, I'll do whatever's acceptable."
    e "好、好的，我会做任何可以接受的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_1df1a9cb:

    # u "You will, trespasser. After all, you know what happens to those who trespasses in my forest."
    u "你会的，擅闯者。毕竟，你知道在我的森林里擅自闯入的人会有什么下场。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_2aeaff21:

    # u "A fate worse than death."
    u "比死亡更糟的命运。"

translate schinese_rewrite moonlit_wolf_den_enter_c6147dc5:

    # "Uffe raises his paws, and the other werewolves quickly scatter rather quickly."
    "乌菲抬起爪子，其他狼人很快便四散开来。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_moonlit_wolf_den_fc60caf0:

    # "You do not dare to enter the werewolf den after helping tetto escape..."
    "你帮了特托逃跑后，就不敢再进入狼人巢穴了……"

translate schinese_rewrite main_moonlit_wolf_den_db99f681:

    # "You slowly enter the cave, holding your weapon to defend yourself properly."
    "你慢慢走进洞窟，握紧武器，好随时自卫。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_moonlit_wolf_den_390dee0d:

    # "The cave seems just as normal as you'd expec-"
    "洞窟看起来和你预想的一样平常，就连——"

translate schinese_rewrite main_moonlit_wolf_den_a27baced:

    # "T-THUNK!"
    "砰——！"

translate schinese_rewrite main_moonlit_wolf_den_5c3fa92f:

    # "Something hits you in the head from behind, and you instantly fall on the ground, unconscious."
    "有什么东西从背后击中了你的脑袋，你立刻倒在地上，失去了意识。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_moonlit_wolf_den_c7fb321b:

    # "As you wake up, a familiar face greets you from above, someone that you know, but never wants to meet again."
    "你醒来时，一张熟悉的脸从上方迎接着你——那是你认识的人，却是你永远不想再见到的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Celebration_Orgy_8780b041:

    # "You enter the den with a surprised face as all werewolves are bare naked, except for Uffe."
    "你一脸惊讶地进入巢穴，发现所有狼人都赤身裸体，只有乌菲除外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Celebration_Orgy_0ea1fe0a:

    # "The werewolves howls loudly, one after another. Your ears are almost exploding with how many of them are draining all their energy just to howl."
    "狼人们一个接一个地大声嚎叫。它们似乎耗尽全部力气只为嚎叫，震得你的耳朵几乎要炸开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Celebration_Orgy_6c153b8a:

    # "Not to mention the echoes in the werewolf den, which makes it ten times worse than you'd think."
    "更别提狼人巢穴里的回声了，糟糕程度远超你的想象。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Celebration_Orgy_42bf90be:

    # "Some of them sit on the rock lazily, howling occassionally in response, some elders crawl on all four, screaming from the inside of their lungs."
    "有些狼人懒洋洋地坐在岩石上，偶尔回应几声嚎叫；一些长者则四肢着地，扯开嗓子大喊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_bbb1b1cd:

    # "You see the werewolf leader, sitting right under the moonlight, looks over at you as you enter the werewolf den."
    "你看见狼人首领坐在月光下，你进入狼人巢穴时，他抬头看向了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_6345f5e8:

    # "There's nothing for him to discuss with you, unless he's suspicious of Vurro's death."
    "除非他对伏罗的死起了疑心，否则他没什么要和你谈的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_7d2dd048:

    # "But, you won't be getting out of this alive, if he finds out about the truth of his brother."
    "但要是他发现了自己兄弟的真相，你就别想活着离开这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_ca997112:

    # "Vurro is already dead, there's nothing for you to discuss right now."
    "伏罗已经死了 你现在没什么好讨论的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_14b648e0:

    # "Unless, he's planning to tie up the last loose end, you are beginning to panic at the possibility."
    "除非……他打算解决最后的隐患。想到这种可能，你开始感到恐慌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_229f8245:

    # "As you turn away, a werewolf bumps onto you from behind, pointing you towards the werewolf leader."
    "你转身离开时，一只狼人从背后撞了你一下，指向狼人首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_0640dfc7:

    # "You reluctantly walk out of the shade, and stops right in front of Uffe."
    "你不情愿地走出阴影，停在乌菲面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_954d67d2:

    # e "H-hello, Uffe."
    e "你、你好，乌菲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_f92c460a:

    # u "Trespasser, you seem to like walking in and out of my sight freely, shall I start welcoming you to our den?"
    u "擅闯者，你似乎很喜欢自由地在我眼前进进出出。要不要我开始欢迎你来我们的巢穴？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_7b1d92f7:

    # e "That's not really necessary, I'll be out of your sight, like... forever."
    e "没这个必要，我会离开你的视线，就像……永远离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_56b17782:

    # u "Don't, it's better for you to stay. After all, you've been surviving for a while."
    u "别这样，留下来对你更好。毕竟，你已经活了一段时间了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_95b1cff1:

    # "Uffe gives you a sneering chuckle, something tells you that it's of a sinister nature."
    "乌菲冷笑了几声，你感觉那笑声带着某种阴森的意味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_0310ef56:

    # u "You must have had a grueling battle with the monster, considering his scent still lingers on you."
    u "你和那头怪物肯定经历了一场苦战，毕竟它的气味仍残留在你身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_93c818a0:

    # e "L-linger?"
    e "残、残留？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_fad9312e:

    # u "I've been aware of your scent for a while."
    u "我已经注意到你的气味有一阵子了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_4715ad3c:

    # u "It reminds me of my childhood. Playing cat and mouse with my brother."
    u "这让我想起了童年。那时我和兄弟玩猫捉老鼠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_a2a9f2d8:

    # u "He liked being the one's of mouse, trying to outsmart me hiding around the forest."
    u "他喜欢当老鼠，躲在森林各处，试图在捉迷藏中胜过我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_fba20bc9:

    # u "And you know what happens at the end of every game?"
    u "你知道每场游戏最后都会发生什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_40545222:

    # "He asks, staring at you menacingly."
    "他盯着你，带着威胁意味问道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_f8dc7a1c:

    # u "I always came out on top."
    u "我总是最后的赢家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_7c2bad15:

    # u "I can just smell where exactly he is."
    u "我能准确闻出他藏在哪里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_2fe1b4ff:

    # e "Isn't that, cheating?"
    e "这不算作弊吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_d2cf2343:

    # "The brown werewolf remain silent."
    "棕色狼人保持沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_58bb4879:

    # "Over a few seconds, his sharp stare slowly turns into a side glance."
    "几秒钟后，他锐利的目光慢慢转成了侧视。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_14da00ed:

    # u "He was my brother, that monster."
    u "那头怪物是我的兄弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_d1fa0c47:

    # "You take a moment to ponder that setence."
    "你花了片刻思考这句话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_4e8f7cc5:

    # u "The smell on you will be the last I'll ever remember him of. As much of a weak link he was..."
    u "我以后能记住他的，就只剩你身上的气味了。尽管他曾是个多么拖后腿的家伙……"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_6d0514fc:

    # u "He was family. There's nothing more important than family."
    u "他是我的家人。没有什么比家人更重要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_0cf5045b:

    # "You are not sure if the sentiment was real, but you decide to take it at face value."
    "你不确定这份情感是否真实，但还是决定照字面相信。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_1423a783:

    # u "We've located the body in the cave, thanks to you, a threat to our pack has been permanently eliminated."
    u "多亏了你，我们已经在洞窟里找到了尸体，威胁我们族群的东西已经被彻底铲除了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_e442b5b6:

    # "You nod at Uffe, and he chuckles, again."
    "你朝乌菲点了点头，他又轻笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_35a16d7b:

    # "He pauses for a moment, as if he's looking for a word."
    "他停顿片刻，像是在寻找合适的措辞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_c080f1e8:

    # u "We have more to do here, trespasser. Leave no stone unturned."
    u "我们还有更多事要做，擅闯者。把这里彻底搜个遍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_4af9ff14:

    # e "The last time you promised me something for my work, you lied."
    e "上次你答应给我报酬时，你撒了谎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_4202a77d:

    # "There's a visible change in his facial expression there, as the alpha seems much more annoyed than you expected."
    "他的表情明显变了，首领看起来比你预想的更加恼怒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_1a3a7ab9:

    # u "If the satisfaction of serving me is not enough, the reward can always be you staying alive, would that be enough of a reward?"
    u "如果为我效劳带来的满足感还不够，奖励也可以是让你活下去；这样的奖励够了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_d029f3da:

    # "That was an abrupt threat, you can't figure out of what to say."
    "这突如其来的威胁让你一时不知该说什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_1f096601:

    # u "Any questions, you better ask right now."
    u "有问题就现在问。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_8b5b4122:

    # "You shrug reluctantly."
    "你不情愿地耸了耸肩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_37437373:

    # u "Now, we need to expand our territories here, starting from the hollow."
    u "现在，我们需要扩大领地，先从空洞开始。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_7b1c1392:

    # u "..."
    u "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_12b9d1fe:

    # "The leader waits for you to speak, but you decide to remain silent in protest of his unfulfilled wish."
    "首领等着你开口，但你决定保持沉默，以此抗议他未兑现的要求。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_a2fed154:

    # u "The hollow is located between our territories, and the slimes', west of the split trails."
    u "空洞位于我们的领地与史莱姆的领地之间，在分岔小径以西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_e09b30f6:

    # e "W-what do you need exactly?"
    e "你、你到底需要我做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_31536831:

    # u "It buries a dark treasure, moonstone amulet. I need you to clear the area, and retrieve what's there for me."
    u "那里埋藏着一件黑暗的宝物：月石护符。我要你清理那片区域，再把里面的东西取回来给我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_cce39311:

    # u "Now go, trespasser."
    u "现在就去，擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_c111e248:

    # e "W-wait, why me? You have other werewolves who are definitely more competent, if not stronger."
    e "等、等等，为什么是我？你手下还有其他狼人，他们肯定更能干，就算不比我强，也一定更胜任。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_59684541:

    # "Uffe only gives a a side glance, not even a full one, he chuckles, and returns to his business."
    "乌菲只是侧眼瞥了你一下，连完整的一眼都没有，轻笑一声后便继续忙自己的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_a58c915c:

    # e "...Alright"
    e "……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_a048460b:

    # "You can feel the other werewolves staring at your dumbfounded face as you remain standing."
    "你能感觉到其他狼人正盯着你那张目瞪口呆的脸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_a4786d2d:

    # "Uffe doesn't bat you another eye before you eventually take your leave."
    "直到你最终离开，乌菲都没有再看你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_afc0fca9:

    # "You notice dozen pairs of eyes hiding in the darkness,. The usual werewolves were staring at you from the corners."
    "你注意到黑暗中藏着几十双眼睛。那些熟悉的狼人正从角落里盯着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_580e8974:

    # e "Uffe, here's the amulet."
    e "乌菲，这是护符。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_8d4747d6:

    # "Something strange is emanating from within the moonstone as you present it in front of Uffe, who takes it eagerly."
    "你把月石展示给乌菲时，护符中散发出某种奇异的气息，他迫不及待地接了过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_f1350236:

    # u "Well done yet again, trespasser."
    u "又做得不错，擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_af79e0df:

    # "He doesn't even bat you another eye, just entirely focused on the amulet."
    "他连看都没再看你一眼，全部注意力都放在护符上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_dd786691:

    # e "Did you send me because your wolves are too stupid to solve riddles?"
    e "你派我去，是因为你的狼人蠢到解不开谜语吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_56609d0f:

    # "Uffe finally glances at you, albeit it's of a hostile nature."
    "乌菲终于瞥了你一眼，目光中带着敌意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_648976f0:

    # u "Stupid? We could have torn you apart right now, including your measly little brain."
    u "蠢？我们现在就能把你撕成碎片，包括你那颗可怜的小脑袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_51b70f01:

    # u "Cleverness doesn't help you survive in this world, trespasser."
    u "小聪明无法帮你在这个世界上活下去，擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_6cf36f0c:

    # e "Then how come you asked me to solve the riddles?"
    e "那你为什么还要让我解谜？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_8bb2680d:

    # u "I can ask you, or, I can put you between my fangs, do you prefer the latter?"
    u "我可以问你，也可以把你夹在獠牙之间。你更喜欢后者吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_f790365e:

    # "You shrug, which only gets Uffe to chuckle lightly."
    "你耸了耸肩，这只让乌菲轻轻笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_7c699b65:

    # u "That's what I thought."
    u "我就知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_d027dc86:

    # "The werewolf alpha puts away the amulet."
    "狼人首领收起了护符。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_05a9cffd:

    # u "You can go now."
    u "你可以走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_9cf2c6d0:

    # e "Are you still not letting me know about the stone, after everything I did?"
    e "我做了这么多，你还是不肯告诉我石头的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_41a78b03:

    # u "I've told you what I know, it's only you who insists I didn't."
    u "我已经把我知道的告诉你了，只是你非要坚持说我没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_f9a01fe1:

    # "You remain silent, perhaps he's right. You are just helping someone who doesn't appreciate your worth."
    "你保持沉默，或许他说得没错。你只是在帮一个不懂得珍惜你价值的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_71691b5a:

    # e "Alright then."
    e "那好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Return_After_Amulet_48dc8cd8:

    # "Uffe stares at you once again, this time of a cautious nature."
    "乌菲再次盯着你，这次的目光带着戒备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_249a39f0:

    # "You arrive in front of the werewolf once more, and the first thing you notice is the extra pairs of eyes staring upon you."
    "你再次来到那只狼人的面前，首先注意到的就是更多双盯着你的眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_c4e47864:

    # u "Welcome back, trespasser."
    u "欢迎回来，擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_ef1fddc8:

    # e "Uffe."
    e "乌菲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_47acd1ff:

    # "You address the alpha with a slightly deeper voice, of which raised his brows briefly."
    "你用稍微低沉的声音向首领打招呼，他短暂地挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_7cfb9203:

    # u "Now that you have proven yourself to be useful. There's another problem I need someone like you to deal with."
    u "既然你已经证明了自己的用处，我还有另一个问题需要像你这样的人来处理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_042ba5d6:

    # u "We've found a group of traitors, runaways, who weren't fit to live in this world."
    u "我们发现了一群叛徒，也就是逃亡者。他们不配活在这个世界上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_ad76d63c:

    # u "They killed a few of ours, and now they plan to escape from the forest, but that's not going to happen."
    u "他们杀了我们几个同伴，现在还打算逃出森林，但那不会发生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_88e456e2:

    # "Uffe glances at you, twiddling his claws against your neck, you instinctively flinch."
    "乌菲瞥了你一眼，爪子在你的脖颈上轻轻摩挲，你本能地瑟缩了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_73f72fff:

    # e "What does that mean, exactly?"
    e "这究竟是什么意思？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_89e01257:

    # u "It means, we're not letting them leave our territory."
    u "意思是，我们不会让他们离开我们的领地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_142c8f80:

    # "His message was rather obvious, you understand that he wants them gone, just like how he wanted his own brother gone."
    "他的话再明显不过了：你明白他想让那些人消失，就像他曾想让自己的兄弟消失一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_27ff24ec:

    # u "Those little weak links will flee like cowards if they see anything that resembles a wolf."
    u "那些弱者一旦看到任何像狼的东西，就会像懦夫一样逃跑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_6e13040e:

    # u "So, I need you to bring them back to me, we'll take over after that."
    u "所以我要你把他们带回来，之后交给我们处理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_3e7f964b:

    # e "I- What are you going to do with them?"
    e "我——你打算拿他们怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_e0486a83:

    # u "You know exactly what I'm going to do."
    u "你很清楚我打算做什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_09c937b0:

    # e "Why? They're already out of the picture, can't you leave them be?"
    e "为什么？他们已经不再构成威胁了，你不能放过他们吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_54252a80:

    # "Uffe raises his eyebrow, his grin vanishes as soon as you finish your sentence."
    "你说完后，乌菲挑起眉毛，脸上的笑意立刻消失。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_77c73601:

    # u "Here I thought you were fit for the rules of nature."
    u "我还以为你已经适应了自然法则。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_7e5be565:

    # e "What?"
    e "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_adea7e66:

    # "He takes a great sigh, and the pack of werewolves behind you immediately tense up."
    "他重重叹了口气，你身后的狼人群立刻绷紧了身体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_b09c993a:

    # u "Trespasser, why do you think only our pack survives in this forest?"
    u "擅闯者，你觉得为什么只有我们的族群能在这片森林里生存？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_d4cd2d06:

    # e "Because you killed everything else?"
    e "因为你们把其他东西都杀光了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_0fb298ca:

    # u "Partly, but there's something more important than killing."
    u "部分原因是，但有件事比杀戮更重要。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_74445d28:

    # u "We survive, we adapt, and we do not hesitate to put out the wildfires before it spreads."
    u "我们生存、适应，并且绝不犹豫在野火蔓延前将它扑灭。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_c8b472e2:

    # "You're not sure if you agree with the wolf even so slightly."
    "你不确定自己是否哪怕稍微同意这头狼的说法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_1481697f:

    # u "So, are you a wildfire?" nointeract
    u "那么，你是野火吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_e4410d82:

    # e "Alright, I'll do it."
    e "好，我会做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_768e5c86:

    # u "Good, maybe after this you'll become one of us."
    u "很好，也许这之后你就会成为我们的一员。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_1990fcc9:

    # e "One of you?"
    e "你们的一员？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_6c5814ca:

    # u "Yes, but first, bring the runaways back to me, then we'll talk about celebration."
    u "没错，但先把逃亡者带回来，我们再谈庆祝的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_ac63d50e:

    # u "Good, then."
    u "很好，那就这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_5ad089c4:

    # "The leader hands you a small wolf-shaped whistle."
    "首领递给你一只小巧的狼形口哨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_84c58b85:

    # u "We found their scent near the northeast of the split trails ahead, so you just need to enter their secret little hiding place."
    u "我们在前方分岔小径的东北方附近发现了他们的气味，所以你只要进入他们秘密的小藏身处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_bfa6064a:

    # u "And when you let their guard down, blow on this. We'll take over from there, and catch them alive."
    u "等他们放松警惕时吹响这个。接下来交给我们，我们会把他们活捉回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_50e0dcee:

    # "You haven't killed anybody that's not a monster, even if you can convince yourself to do this..."
    "你还从没杀过不是怪物的人，即便你能说服自己去做这件事……"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_64f8988a:

    # "The guilt of sending the werewolves to their death sentence are going to kill you alive."
    "把狼人送上死刑台的罪恶感会活活折磨死你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_2e275ff0:

    # u "You should go now, catch them while they're least expected."
    u "你现在就该出发，在他们最没有防备的时候抓住他们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_52926d41:

    # "You nod, and you politely take your leave, walking past the werewolves that guard the entrance."
    "你点点头，礼貌地告辞，经过守在入口处的狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_0756858e:

    # "It's a choice you must make, and it makes you nauseous to be in control of someone else's life directly."
    "这是你必须做出的选择，而直接掌控另一个人的生死让你恶心得想吐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_a412f9a3:

    # "But deep down you know there's another option, to not participate in the sick game of Uffe's, ever again."
    "但在内心深处，你知道自己还有另一个选择：永远不再参与乌菲那场恶心的游戏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_f3f7ef7d:

    # e "No, I'm not going to do it."
    e "不，我不会做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_6b5ccd06:

    # u "Well then, you are dismissed."
    u "那么，你可以走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_93f9b5a4:

    # e "Is that it? Y-you are not going to do anything else?"
    e "就这样？你、你不会再做别的事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_2d595eb9:

    # u "Do you want to live? If not, then keep talking, we'll take care of you as well."
    u "你想活命吗？不想的话，就继续说下去，我们也会顺便解决掉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_e738fd84:

    # "You gulp, his threats are always successful in shutting your mouth, though you are also to be blamed."
    "你咽了口唾沫。他的威胁总能成功让你闭嘴，不过你自己也难辞其咎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_f8910eb9:

    # u "We'll catch those runaways with force, either way they're not leaving the forest."
    u "不管怎样，我们都会强行抓住那些逃亡者，他们绝不可能离开森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_62e9d3ae:

    # u "My people are just too good at killing, it's a shame they can't bring the runaways alive for me."
    u "我的人太擅长杀戮了，可惜他们没法把逃亡者活着带回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_acd83549:

    # "He pauses for a few seconds, and glances at you again."
    "他停顿了几秒，又瞥了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_a78c9945:

    # u "Are you waiting to be dismissed, or be our food?"
    u "你是在等我打发你走，还是想成为我们的食物？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_55cced4b:

    # e "Neither, but I wish you're not as cruel as you were meant to be."
    e "都不是，但我希望你没那么残忍。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_e46528de:

    # u "It's actually quite amusing that you think you have any say in other's decision."
    u "你居然觉得自己能对别人的决定说了算，真是相当可笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_708f62c6:

    # "Uffe sharpens his claw on the stone surface, urging you to leave the cave."
    "乌菲在石面上磨着爪子，催促你离开洞窟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_6ff04e9e:

    # u "We'll meet again, trespasser."
    u "我们还会再见的，擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_74a6b80f:

    # "You turn away quickly, walking past the werewolves that guard the entrance."
    "你迅速转身，经过守在入口处的狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_4125b3a4:

    # "There is no way Uffe is asking you to help kill those escaping the forest."
    "乌菲不可能是在让你帮忙杀掉那些逃出森林的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_c806a6ac:

    # "And that means you may never come back to the den again, at least until something changed."
    "这意味着你可能再也不会回到巢穴，至少在事情发生改变之前不会。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Start_Runaways_5670ee01:

    # "Hopefully, that change might come the day Wuldon takes his revenge, and you'll help him with all your heart poured out."
    "希望这改变会发生在沃尔顿复仇的那天，而你会倾尽全力帮助他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_798356f8:

    # "You knock on the wooden plank again."
    "你又敲了敲木板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_b5aeb287:

    # "The werewolf peeks up."
    "狼人探出头来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_75e83c0f:

    # my "Do you have anything that helps my brother?"
    my "你有没有什么能帮我兄弟的东西？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_fe387f79:

    # "You knock on the unsuspecting wooden plank, turns out, it's a door."
    "你敲了敲毫无防备的木板，结果发现那其实是一扇门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_0c7c2fde:

    # "A sound from leaves cracking from behind reminds you that there are werewolves guarding outside the hiding place."
    "身后传来树叶碎裂的声音，提醒你藏身处外面有狼人看守。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_34aeeddc:

    # "And then, you hear someone chattering through the other side."
    "然后，你听见另一边有人在低声交谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_28954fac:

    # "Someone whimpered, very loudly."
    "有人发出呜咽声，声音大得惊人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_e26491d4:

    # "Another unfamiliar voice spooks you away, until you notice he was addressing you."
    "另一个陌生的声音把你吓了一跳，直到你注意到他是在对你说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_d0140213:

    # my "You're not a werewolf, who are you?"
    my "你不是狼人，你是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_09480d25:

    # "You don't know who was talking from the other side, or how he can see you through the door."
    "你不知道门的另一边是谁在说话，也不知道他怎么能透过门看见你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_95712d5c:

    # e "I-I'm from outside the forest, just wanted to take a rest after exploring the area."
    e "我、我是从森林外来的，只是在探索这片区域后想找个地方休息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_45e047c9:

    # e "May I come in?"
    e "我可以进去吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_6ddc9df5:

    # my "Hmm..."
    my "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_7116e930:

    # my "Rumma? Should we let him in."
    my "鲁玛？我们要让他进来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_04b3d1c6:

    # "The werewolf calls someone far away, you can hear someone coughing before he runs."
    "狼人向远处喊了一个人的名字，你听见有人咳嗽了一声，随后那人跑开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_814d22c7:

    # my "F-fuck."
    my "该、该死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_25270619:

    # "It seems the werewolf is taking care of someone inside the house."
    "看来这个狼人正在照顾屋里的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_37f64fc5:

    # "You lean against the door, trying to listen to whatever was happening with the werewolves, but they were too far away."
    "你靠在门上，试图听清狼人们在做什么，但他们离得太远了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_116c23e6:

    # "After a few ganders, you notice a hole in the entrance that let you see through whatever inside the house."
    "你又张望了几次，注意到入口处有个洞，可以透过它看到屋内的情况。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_76452d84:

    # "But still, there's nothing notable except for the wooden planks sealed tight at the other side of the door."
    "但依然没看到什么值得注意的东西，除了门另一侧封得严严实实的木板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_c265b054:

    # "A few minutes have passed, you dwindle around idly until you see a maned werewolf at the door."
    "几分钟过去了，你百无聊赖地在附近徘徊，直到看见一只鬃毛狼人来到门边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_b5f55056:

    # "That's when your eyes both met, but you both quickly avert your gazes."
    "这时你们四目相对，但很快便各自移开了视线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_3e01c4e8:

    # my "We don't accept any visitors right now."
    my "我们现在不接待访客。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_cc3774d7:

    # my "But... my brother, he needs something to heal his wound."
    my "但是……我兄弟需要一些治疗伤口的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_6baab327:

    # e "Would a health potion help?"
    e "治疗药水可以吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_ca741087:

    # my "N-no, I've already tried it."
    my "不、不行，我已经试过了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_bd0311ae:

    # "You hear the same whimper from someone far inside the hiding place."
    "你听见藏身处深处又传来同样的呜咽声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_b6f603d9:

    # my "He needs something to apply on his wound, it's getting worse and he can't stop bleeding."
    my "他需要能敷在伤口上的东西，伤势越来越严重，而且血止不住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_55847294:

    # my "Ever since the herbalist wolf disappeared, there's been no one in the forest that can help treat our sicknesses and injuries."
    my "自从草药师狼人失踪后，森林里就没人能帮我们治疗疾病和伤势了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_c13d718f:

    # e "Herbalist wolf?"
    e "草药师狼人？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_4808df18:

    # my "He walks around the forest, do you not know him?"
    my "他会在森林里四处走动，你不认识他吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_258b58d1:

    # "The werewolf pauses over the door, seems like he's staring at the other direction."
    "狼人停在门边，似乎正盯着另一个方向。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_162da881:

    # my "Can you help us? I must stay in case of any other werewolves coming in."
    my "你能帮帮我们吗？我必须留在这里，以防有其他狼人进来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_3681f1cd:

    # "You walk around, but find nothing."
    "你四处走了走，但什么也没找到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_0bb8a53d:

    # e "I- I don't think I have anything that can help him."
    e "我、我想我没有能帮他的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_57a92751:

    # my "That's alright, I'll think of another way."
    my "没关系，我再想想别的办法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_324e6a2b:

    # "Without another thought, he turns away."
    "他不再多想，转身离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_61f642e1:

    # "You hear the footsteps of the werewolf leaving to tend to his brother, before you retreat from the door as well."
    "你听见狼人离开的脚步声，他要去照料自己的兄弟，于是你也从门边退开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_b4fa7e8d:

    # "You approach the alpha once more."
    "你再次走近首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_fe5eda14:

    # u "Congratulations, my little trespasser. The threat has been eliminated, as it should."
    u "恭喜你，我的小擅闯者。威胁已经被铲除，一切本就该如此。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_834c8ef8:

    # u "Keep the whistle, as a reward."
    u "留着这只口哨，就当作奖励。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_66df7fbb:

    # e "What are you going to do with them?"
    e "你打算拿他们怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_b45f40e0:

    # u "I'm sorry?"
    u "你说什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_4d3c304e:

    # e "What are you going to d-"
    e "你打算拿他们——"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_53369edd:

    # u "Look, you might not remember the rules in my forest for merely a second here. Let me reiterate."
    u "听着，你可能只是一时忘了我森林里的规矩。让我再重申一次。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_aebd86cf:

    # "The alpha cuts you off, he is visibly annoyed."
    "首领打断了你，脸上明显带着恼意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_c8eaab5d:

    # u "I'll do with them however I want, and it's not something I will tell a trespasser."
    u "我想怎么处置他们就怎么处置，这是不会告诉一个擅闯者的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_23e5ffc3:

    # u "However, you seem visibly upset for strangers you know nothing about."
    u "不过，看来你居然会为一群素不相识的人感到难过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_3c65e6f4:

    # u "Let me comfort you, the brothers are sound and safe, for all it's worth."
    u "让我安慰你一下吧，那两兄弟平安无事，至少这也算值得。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_c2b003d7:

    # e "You still haven't answered my questions."
    e "你还是没有回答我的问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_76546a42:

    # "Uffe chides."
    "乌菲训斥道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_b87788c9:

    # u "Now you've crossed the line. I don't really owe you an explanation, trespasser."
    u "你越界了。我没义务向你解释，擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_9fb556fb:

    # u "But consider that you've contributed to the pack. I will forgive you."
    u "但看在你为族群出过力的份上，我会原谅你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_3dd0ceb1:

    # u "And mayhaps, come another time. We'll hold a celebration for the removal of all threats."
    u "或许改天再来。到时我们会为清除所有威胁举行庆祝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_7df617a4:

    # "You remain silent, by now you know everything you say will be disregarded."
    "你保持沉默，因为现在你已经知道，无论说什么都会被置之不理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_fec5f55d:

    # "And despite your action, you were right, the guilt of blowing the whistle is building up on you."
    "尽管是你做出的选择，但你是对的；吹响口哨的罪恶感正在压垮你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_53a60d55:

    # "Alongside what you've done to Vurro..."
    "再加上你对伏罗所做的一切……"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Runaways_End_c896e7be:

    # "It's not going to go away."
    "这份罪恶感不会消失。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_6b70fcfd:

    # e "Uhmm..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_c11334f3:

    # "You scramble through your bag, and finds a canister of green ointment."
    "你在包里一阵翻找，找到了一罐绿色药膏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_f6f37971:

    # e "Would this help?"
    e "这个有用吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_48eea0fa:

    # "Through the hole, you raise your hand high enough for the wolf."
    "你从洞里伸出手，把药膏举到足够让狼人看见的高度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_5221f0d0:

    # my "What's that?"
    my "那是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_263a01ef:

    # e "Ointment, it should stop the bleeding speedily. Ol- A lizard from outside the forest gave the recipe to me."
    e "药膏，应该能很快止血。哦——是森林外的一只蜥蜴把配方给我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_55d9376e:

    # my "That will help?"
    my "这个能帮上忙？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_88725662:

    # e "I'm pretty sure."
    e "我相当确定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_a6ca64fd:

    # "Clumsily, you throw it over the hole in the door, the concerned wolf catches the canister before it breaks on the floor."
    "你笨拙地把它从门上的洞扔过去，担心的狼人接住了药罐，没让它摔在地上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_631a6d3a:

    # "He quickly rushes towards the back of the hut, muttering something very quickly."
    "他飞快地冲向小屋深处，嘴里飞快地嘟囔着什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_1fc15b3d:

    # "You wait at the door, and it's been almost an hour passed before the wolf approaches you again."
    "你在门边等着，差不多过了一个小时，那只狼人才再次来到你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_52fb519f:

    # my "Thank you so much, I- I think my brother's getting better now, his bleeding has stopped and I wiped his wounds clean."
    my "太谢谢你了，我——我觉得我兄弟现在好多了，他的血已经止住，我也把他的伤口清理干净了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_65508ba3:

    # e "T-that's great, I'm happy to have helped you."
    e "太好了，我很高兴能帮到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_212f93f4:

    # my "Do you want to come in?"
    my "你想进来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_118adec5:

    # e "Yes."
    e "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_0d74ee2f:

    # "The werewolf flips open the wooden plank, and greets you politely."
    "狼人掀开木板，礼貌地迎接你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_5688ed42:

    # "It's only after entering the hiding place you notice how small it is."
    "进来后你才发现，这个藏身处小得可怜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_13f25f51:

    # "And the werewolf is taller than you imagined, almost like a giant as compared to the compact household he's living in."
    "而这只狼人比你想象中更高，和他居住的狭小住所相比，几乎像个巨人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_a6bb13e5:

    # "The hut is buried under simple sticks and stones, with a tunnel towards what you presume to be where the other werewolf is at."
    "小屋埋在简陋的木棍与石头下，还有一条通往你猜测是另一只狼人所在位置的隧道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_dc21eb6d:

    # my "S-sorry, it's small but we are not staying for long here."
    my "抱、抱歉，地方是小了点，但我们不会在这里待太久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_b19a9e16:

    # "You sit on the leafy mat alongside the werewolf."
    "你和狼人一起坐在铺着树叶的垫子上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_37c19554:

    # tt "My name's Tetto, it was really nice to meet you."
    tt "我叫特托，很高兴认识你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_83e2f008:

    # e "My name's [e]. Thank you for having me here, Tetto."
    e "我的名字是[e]。谢谢你让我进来，特托。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_7e0dd842:

    # e "Where are you going?"
    e "你们要去哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_268d878b:

    # tt "Somewhere far away from the forest, once my brother can walk again."
    tt "去森林之外的某个遥远地方，等我兄弟能重新走路之后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_3884e7c2:

    # e "I apologise if I stepped out of line, but what happened to your brother?"
    e "如果我有些越界，我向你道歉，但你兄弟到底怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_f6ca09a5:

    # "The werewolf scratches his head."
    "狼人挠了挠头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_242f534e:

    # tt "Well, we were sick of the hunting, ever since the previous leader went feral in that cave, we were forced back to hunt and gather food for the alpha."
    tt "嗯，我们厌倦了狩猎。自从前任首领在那座洞窟里狂化后，我们就被迫重新为首领狩猎、采集食物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_0491d755:

    # tt "And... we got into a fight, with one of the elders of the pack, he found out that we were trying to escape from the forest."
    tt "而且……我们和族群中的一位长老打了一架，他发现我们正试图逃离森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_d01f6ed8:

    # tt "My brother fought hard to protect me, but his shoulder was clawed before the elder took his last breath."
    tt "我兄弟拼命保护我，但他的肩膀被抓伤了，随后那位长老才咽下最后一口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_0f0cd218:

    # tt "So we hid, I found this place with a natural shelter, trying to get something to heal his wound up."
    tt "所以我们躲了起来。我找到了这个天然的避难所，想弄些东西治好他的伤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_6d17913f:

    # e "Are the other werewolves still chasing after you?"
    e "其他狼人还在追你们吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_9c690365:

    # tt "I presume so."
    tt "我想是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_e053aef6:

    # tt "We'll finally leave this place as soon as my brother can finally walk. There were so much stuff we wanted to see."
    tt "等我兄弟终于能走路，我们就会离开这里。还有好多东西等着我们去看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_446aa2c2:

    # tt "You know, so much to take a gander."
    tt "你懂的，有太多东西值得去瞧瞧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_ecdaeb35:

    # "The werewolf exclaims, with a bit of excitement in his eyes."
    "狼人说道，眼中带着一丝兴奋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_ed8951c2:

    # tt "My brother said the goats looked funny, but I've never seen them ever before."
    tt "我兄弟说山羊看起来很滑稽，但我以前从没见过它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_21f01dfd:

    # tt "He said they have a pair of horns, like yours. W-wait, are you a goat?"
    tt "他说它们有一对和你一样的角。等、等等，你是山羊吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_c6899adb:

    # e "N-no, we just looked similar."
    e "不、不是，只是我们看起来有点像。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_78eb2d4c:

    # tt "Well, I wasn't the wisest one in terms of faces and other people."
    tt "嗯，说到辨认脸和其他人，我可不是最聪明的那个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_d4c9a9a0:

    # "He chuckles, staring back at the room."
    "他轻笑着，回头望向房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_4c40cd50:

    # tt "Do you like herbs? I've read from the herbalist wolf while he was still around."
    tt "你喜欢草药吗？我以前从草药师狼人那里读过一些东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_0dddfc54:

    # tt "He collected everything in the dark forest, sometimes even outside our territory, and I helped him grind the herbs together."
    tt "他会在黑暗森林里收集各种东西，有时甚至会去领地外，而我帮他把草药一起研磨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_f7aa6954:

    # "He points towards the mortar and pestle on the floor, it's almost all green now, with the center being rough like barks of a tree."
    "他指向地板上的研钵和杵。现在它们几乎全被染成了绿色，中央粗糙得像树皮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_bfc53378:

    # tt "I've heard of the dragon alchemist from him, perhaps after leaving the forest, we can visit him for his herbs."
    tt "我从他那里听说过龙族炼金术士。也许离开森林后，我们可以去找他弄些草药。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_d61743db:

    # e "You're really talkative, aren't you?"
    e "你还真健谈，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_5be9f915:

    # tt "Hah, sorry, I was just too excited to finally leave the forest. It has been a mess ever since Uffe took control again."
    tt "哈，抱歉。我只是太兴奋了，终于能离开森林。自从乌菲重新掌权后，这里一直乱糟糟的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_ca600427:

    # tt "And my brother, he wasn't the type of werewolf who likes to be told what to do."
    tt "而且我兄弟不是那种喜欢听人指挥的狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_26635a77:

    # "Tetto exclaims as he squeezes the back of his neck."
    "特托说着，捏了捏后颈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_ad8a270d:

    # tt "Anyway, thanks for the ointment, I think my brother's going to like you a lot when he wakes up."
    tt "总之，谢谢你的药膏。我想我兄弟醒来后一定会很喜欢你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_4635653e:

    # e "You're welcome."
    e "不客气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_80672710:

    # "Staring at the werewolf, you try to put away the thought to blow the whistle and potentially killing them both."
    "你盯着那只狼人，努力压下吹响口哨、可能杀死他们兄弟二人的念头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_1fed4637:

    # "After all, how is it possible for you to do it? The guilt will surely drown you alive."
    "毕竟，你怎么可能做得到？那份罪恶感一定会将你淹没。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_c7341cb5:

    # "You nudge on the whistle intensely, trying to resist the idea to ever get your mouth near it."
    "你用力摩挲着口哨，努力克制住把它放到嘴边的冲动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_d7f1406e:

    # "And to think about the decision, it's not even worth, for whatever Uffe had in plans for you, there's no way you'd risk the lives of two innocent werewolves."
    "可一想到这个决定，你又觉得根本不值得。无论乌菲计划让你做什么，你都不可能拿两个无辜狼人的性命去冒险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_6bbccce5:

    # "You thoughts was put to a sudden halt as you hear the series of whines again."
    "你再次听见那一连串呜咽声，思绪突然被打断。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_1f58b189:

    # tt "O-oh?"
    tt "哦、哦？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_b4497e10:

    # tt "It's my brother. I'll check on him for just a few moments."
    tt "是我兄弟。我去看看他，马上就回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_b5798c21:

    # "The werewolf climbs on the tunnel, and soon you are left alone..."
    "狼人爬进隧道，很快就只剩你一个人……"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_b4a35f9a:

    # "You take out the whistle, there's no pulling out now."
    "你拿出口哨，现在已经没有回头路了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_a4a30430:

    # "There's no way you can blow it here."
    "你不可能在这里吹响它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_2881133f:

    # "You leave the place with a look of sorrow, before barely sealing the plank at the entrance."
    "你带着悲伤离开，在入口处勉强把木板封好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_6aeeec2d:

    # "Indecisively, you close your eyes, and let your mouth blow a soft wind through the whistle."
    "你犹豫着闭上眼，让嘴唇向口哨中吹入一缕轻风。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_dc7068f1:

    # "A loud sound emulating wolf howling can be heard through the whole forest."
    "一声模仿狼嚎的巨响传遍了整片森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_6484a0bd:

    # "You run away from the shelter, knowing what will happen to them."
    "你逃离避难所，知道他们将会遭遇什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_f68064e8:

    # "And you do not even dare to look behind."
    "你甚至不敢回头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_4ecb9225:

    # "You do not have the courage to see what you're doing to them."
    "你没有勇气看着自己对他们做出这种事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_59bb6834:

    # "Soon, a group of werewolves emerges from the corner, running in opposite direction of yours."
    "很快，一群狼人从角落里出现，朝与你相反的方向奔去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_af23c6b6:

    # "One of the werewolves stops you."
    "其中一只狼人拦住了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_bec3aaa9:

    # ww "You got their doors unlocked?"
    ww "你把他们的门打开了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_d98e7959:

    # ww "Good job there, Uffe will be very pleased."
    ww "干得不错，乌菲一定会很满意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_39acc06a:

    # "You wish it was a sarcasm, but he genuinely believed you did a good thing."
    "你希望那只是讽刺，但他是真心认为你做了件好事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_9a3b67cb:

    # e "Are they going to die?"
    e "他们会死吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_05886071:

    # ww "What? Hah- If we wanted to kill them, they'd die a long time ago."
    ww "什么？哈——我们要是想杀他们，他们早就没命了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_0999ae93:

    # ww "We just didn't want them to escape, or die that easily."
    ww "我们只是不想让他们逃走，也不想让他们那么轻易地死掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_d916959f:

    # "The werewolf points at his head, and grins at you menacingly."
    "狼人指了指自己的脑袋，朝你露出阴森的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_2e2f23b2:

    # "You are not sure what he means, how would Uffe not kill a threat to their own pack."
    "你不确定他是什么意思。乌菲怎么可能不杀掉威胁到他们族群的家伙？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_af683f97:

    # "What's even the purpose of catching them alive?"
    "把他们活捉到底有什么意义？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_927eea20:

    # ww "Leave the hard works to us, little prey."
    ww "艰难的活交给我们，小猎物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_efbcbcbc:

    # ww "Oh, and you should go tell Uffe about the good news, I'm sure he has something better ready for you."
    ww "哦，你应该去告诉乌菲这个好消息。我相信他已经为你准备了更好的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_4580b4a2:

    # "The werewolf chuckles, before heading the direction to the shelter."
    "狼人轻笑一声，朝避难所的方向走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_bea31d56:

    # "And you are left standing there, speechless."
    "只剩你站在那里，说不出话来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_a9c848fb:

    # "You can only hope they have fled, somehow. Even if it's unrealistic."
    "你只能希望他们不知怎么逃掉了，哪怕这并不现实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_2e84dca1:

    # e "Hey, Tetto, you need to leave... now."
    e "嘿，特托，你得离开……现在就走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_f026b0c5:

    # tt "W-what?"
    tt "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_3d5270c8:

    # e "Carry your brother and leave the forest, the werewolves are chasing after you."
    e "带上你兄弟离开森林，狼人正在追你们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_4d211de9:

    # e "They are coming here right now! So please... run."
    e "他们现在就要到这里了！所以求你……快跑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_5654ba5c:

    # "You shout at the other end of the tunnel, the werewolf seems to be pondering for a moment."
    "你朝隧道另一端大喊，那只狼人似乎思考了片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_e3d5e1a9:

    # "He ponders for a moment, before looking outside through a peephole."
    "他思索了一会儿，随后从窥孔向外看去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_f992a567:

    # "It only get him much more anxious, as he immediately rushes towards his brother."
    "这一看让他更加焦急，他立刻冲向自己的兄弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_004a3d2a:

    # tt "Fuck- you're right. Okay, I'm so lucky he built a secret exit right here, I'll carry my brother."
    tt "该死——你说得对。还好他在这里建了秘密出口，我来背我兄弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_ca020225:

    # e "I'll do whatever I can, please, run as far as you can."
    e "我会尽我所能，求你跑得越远越好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_3aef8799:

    # tt "Alright, alright. I can do this."
    tt "好，好。我能做到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_882662a2:

    # "Tetto groans as he carries his brother on his back, you can still hear a few whimpers from the brother."
    "特托背起兄弟时发出呻吟，你仍能听见他兄弟的几声呜咽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_ddca1947:

    # tt "[e], may we meet outside."
    tt "[e]，希望我们能在外面再见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_affbb762:

    # "A faint gruntle echoes from the other end of the tunnel. And you can only hope they've escaped."
    "隧道另一端传来一声微弱的咕哝。你只能希望他们已经逃脱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_863894c9:

    # "You wait for a few seconds alone in the hiding place."
    "你独自在藏身处等了几秒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_d8bd2fc4:

    # "They must not catch them until you blow your whistle, as you believe."
    "你相信，在你吹响口哨前，它们一定不会被抓住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_93224bbd:

    # e "Hey! I should accompany you two, it's too dangerous."
    e "嘿！我应该陪你们一起走，外面太危险了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_9ad41c1f:

    # "You shout loudly, but receive no response except for your echoes."
    "你大声喊道，但除了自己的回声外没有得到任何回应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_e92d1514:

    # "Despite the silence, you climb into the tunnel, hoping to catch up to the brothers."
    "尽管一片寂静，你还是爬进隧道，希望能追上那两兄弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_2c351a03:

    # "With a certain ease and dust on your body, you reached where his brother was resting."
    "你轻松穿过满是尘土的隧道，来到他兄弟休息的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_87591478:

    # "There are an incredible amount of blood left behind, almost enough to stain a whole carpet."
    "留下的血多得惊人，几乎足以染红整张地毯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_710b8610:

    # "But, without another thought, you hurry to flip away layers and layers of leaves hiding the other exit."
    "但你来不及多想，赶紧掀开一层又一层遮住另一个出口的树叶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_1c5c4593:

    # "Running into several huge bushes, you see the back of a werewolf moving slowly above the grasses."
    "你跑进几片巨大的灌木丛，看见一只狼人的背影在草丛上方缓慢移动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_9c2b1e20:

    # "When you walk up to the werewolf's side, you realise he's sleeping soundly, being carried by his brother underneath."
    "走到狼人身边时，你才发现他正睡得很沉，而他的兄弟正背着他前进。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_95bea4e4:

    # e "Tetto, I figured maybe you can use an extra pair of eyes."
    e "特托，我想你可能需要多一双眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_c16e797b:

    # tt "Hnnngh... Good."
    tt "嗯——好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_037aaa36:

    # "Tetto gruntles as his brother almost slips off."
    "特托发出一声咕哝，他的兄弟差点从背上滑下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_86cd8374:

    # tt "I figured that sooner or later, they're gonna track down Rumma's blood. Luckily he's left his share of evidence back there."
    tt "我想他们迟早会顺着鲁玛的血迹追来。幸好他在那边留下了不少证据。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_a4a98ac9:

    # tt "It's how we work, even if we can't kill our preys, they'll just keep bleeding until we finish our jobs."
    tt "我们就是这样做的。即使没能杀死猎物，它们也会一直流血，直到我们完成任务。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_90e5a288:

    # tt "Didn't h-hnngh... think we'd be the prey today."
    tt "没、没——嗯……没想到今天我们会变成猎物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_123074d8:

    # "You walk alongside the wolf, peeking from left to right."
    "你走在狼人身边，左右张望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_fb20963c:

    # tt "Anyway, usually we have to move past the nightwatches, but I know a path ahead that the werewolves seldom use."
    tt "通常我们得穿过夜哨的区域，但我知道前面有条狼人很少走的小路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_466cf92b:

    # tt "The path is longer, but doable. Walt taught me about this path, he was the herbalist wolf."
    tt "沃尔特教过我这条路，他就是那位草药师狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_73240f8f:

    # tt "He was fairly old, and it's been a while since I last saw him, maybe the toxic herbs just eventually caught up with him."
    tt "他年纪很大了，而且我也有一阵子没见过他了。也许他最终还是被那些有毒草药害死了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_2df47b8b:

    # tt "Or, maybe it was Uffe."
    tt "或者，也许是乌菲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_bc07a041:

    # "Tetto glances at you."
    "特托瞥了你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_84c64760:

    # tt "But, still. Back to the business, I think we shouldn't be talking that much."
    tt "不过，先回到正事上。我觉得我们不该说这么多话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_d165ef5a:

    # e "Yeah? You think so?"
    e "是吗？你也这么觉得？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_8e328936:

    # tt "Forgot we were supposed to be fleeing."
    tt "我忘了我们本来是在逃命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_758d7981:

    # "Tetto picks up his pace from merely walking, and you follow closely."
    "特托从慢走加快了脚步，你紧紧跟在后面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_060b63d4:

    # tt "See anything funny?"
    tt "看到什么奇怪的东西了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_a890c771:

    # e "Ehm, nothing yet."
    e "呃，还没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_290b18bd:

    # tt "My brother is heavy, I thought I should let you carry him but then you're just this tweenzy little small dude."
    tt "我兄弟很重。本来我想让你来背他，但你只是个小小的、瘦巴巴的家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_4634bf20:

    # tt "Not saying small dudes are weak but his sheer weight is going to break your bones."
    tt "我不是说个头小就一定弱，但他的体重绝对会把你的骨头压断。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_5f2c1ea5:

    # tt "Of course, we're born heavier and our strength comes with that extra weight."
    tt "当然，我们天生就更重，而额外的重量也带来了力量。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_5c57b3f8:

    # "The werewolf continues rambling about random talks, which just causes you to be much more nervous looking around."
    "狼人继续絮絮叨叨地说着些无关紧要的话，让你更加紧张，不停地环顾四周。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_94bdedaa:

    # tt "Blessed by our ancestors, and Metsikka, we'd be able to shred down anyone in the forest."
    tt "有祖先和梅茨卡的赐福，我们就能把森林里的任何人撕成碎片。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_b173526c:

    # tt "But we have abandoned our gods, as they said, our prayers went unheard for centuries almost."
    tt "但我们抛弃了自己的神明。正如他们所说，我们的祈祷几乎已经数百年无人回应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_7a090ea0:

    # e "Gods?"
    e "神明？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_28422c94:

    # "You look backwards, luckily no one is tailing you right now."
    "你回头看去，幸好现在没有人跟踪你们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_ec52d55b:

    # tt "Ancestors with quite a bit of power. Every tribe has their own."
    tt "拥有强大力量的祖先。每个族群都有自己的祖先。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_2ddff205:

    # tt "But we're not really a tribe, we don't do rituals and festivals."
    tt "但我们其实算不上族群，我们不举行仪式，也没有节庆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_ea8dff13:

    # tt "Wait, are we a tribe?"
    tt "等等，我们算是一个族群吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_f1642409:

    # e "Maybe."
    e "也许吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_8cdcb8f6:

    # "He's getting increasingly annoying while you're trying to focus on any potential threats."
    "你正努力留意可能的威胁，而他越来越让人心烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_becb089c:

    # tt "Probably a better tribe than those at the sea."
    tt "肯定比海边那些族群更像样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_293eb1b2:

    # "Tetto chuckles as you hear a weak snoring from the back."
    "特托轻笑起来，你听见后方传来微弱的鼾声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_9fe2074a:

    # "The maned werewolf turns his attention to his brother, who is sleeping comfortably on his back."
    "鬃毛狼人把注意力转向他的兄弟，后者正舒舒服服地仰面睡着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_a18c0165:

    # tt "I wonder what he's dreaming about, he's been having nightmares since getting clawed."
    tt "不知道他在做什么梦。他被抓伤后就一直在做噩梦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_80ce3f89:

    # tt "It's no-"
    tt "这不——"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_f1876c0d:

    # e "Are you sure people aren't going to hear that?"
    e "你确定别人不会听见吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_fd379225:

    # tt "What, the snores?"
    tt "什么，鼾声吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_0e2989e8:

    # tt "It's the first time I've heard him snore since we escaped, and it was all because of me."
    tt "自从我们逃出来，这是我第一次听见他打鼾，都是因为我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_ef859802:

    # e "I mean, it's that, and you're really talking like we're not hiding from a whole pack of vicious werewolves."
    e "我的意思是，除了这个之外，你还一直说个不停，好像我们不是在躲避一整群凶残的狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_a46835c1:

    # tt "Ha, well. And you're talking like my brother. He always did all the worrying for me."
    tt "哈，好吧。你说话的样子倒是很像我兄弟。他总是替我操心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_0bbc472c:

    # tt "Should've helped when he built the small cave alone, I think that's when the elder got his eyes on him."
    tt "他独自建那个小洞窟时我本该帮忙的，我想那就是长老盯上他的开始。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_47df7fcb:

    # "You continue listening to Tetto as he half-heartedly whispers, but something caught onto your eyes."
    "你继续听着特托有气无力的低语，但某个东西吸引了你的目光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_a0da3a2e:

    # e "Duck!"
    e "趴下！"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_05d8ebf2:

    # tt "Huh? Where- Oh!"
    tt "啊？哪儿——哦！"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_a809a401:

    # "Tetto abruptly pauses mid-sentence as his gaze fixates upon a familiar figure, it was another werewolf."
    "特托说到一半突然停下，目光锁定在一个熟悉的身影上——那是另一只狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_abc10962:

    # "You drag him behind a weirdly bulky tree, just in time before the werewolf turns towards your direction."
    "你把他拖到一棵异常粗大的树后，就在狼人转向你们之前及时躲好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_50214462:

    # ww "Could've sworn I smelled something suspicious here."
    ww "我明明闻到这里有可疑的气味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_60361856:

    # "The werewolf tilts his head left and right, trying to make sense of the scent probably from the wounded brother."
    "狼人左右歪着头，试图辨认这股气味，大概来自受伤的兄弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_be1a890e:

    # tt "{size=25}So, how are we going to get out of this?{/size}"
    tt "{size=25}那么，我们要怎么逃出去？{/size}"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_8c357fe6:

    # e "{size=15}Are you seriously still talking while we're being tracked down?{/size}"
    e "{size=15}你认真的吗？我们正被追踪，你居然还在说个不停？{/size}"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_f958cf8f:

    # tt "{size=15}Sorry!{/size}"
    tt "{size=15}抱歉！{/size}"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_9d2c83b8:

    # "At last, he finally quiets down. But that doesn't stop the werewolf's pursuit."
    "他终于安静下来。但那并没有阻止狼人的追捕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_aa1b37b3:

    # "Instead, you notice another similar figure approaching."
    "相反，你注意到又有一个相似的身影靠近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_b634616f:

    # ww "Got any tails? Uffe's gonna be pissed if we let them escape."
    ww "有发现他们的踪迹吗？要是让他们逃掉，乌菲会气疯的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_1c1b51cc:

    # ww2 "No, but I just received order from the alpha. We better take them back as soon as we can."
    ww2 "没有，但我刚收到首领的命令。我们最好尽快把他们带回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_c10418db:

    # ww "Including the small one?"
    ww "包括那个小个子？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_fb3a4346:

    # ww2 "No."
    ww2 "不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_8b06c217:

    # "The werewolves talks amongst themselves nonchalantly, sharpening their claws as they search."
    "狼人们若无其事地交谈着，一边搜寻一边磨利爪子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_09f6d4e2:

    # "You hold your breath behind the giant tree, and signal Tetto to escape as soon as the werewolves leave."
    "你屏住呼吸，示意特托等狼人离开后立刻逃走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_371deeeb:

    # ww "Someone's been here."
    ww "有人来过这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_00771fda:

    # "The two look across the path you just took, and they immediately follows the scent down there."
    "两人看向你刚才走过的小路，立刻沿着气味追了过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_a64bd019:

    # "You continue to hold your breath, just a few more seconds before they leave."
    "你继续屏住呼吸，再过几秒他们就会离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_7f6ccb4c:

    # "One... More..."
    "再……一下……"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_1a502c10:

    # "Alas, you flinch and step on the dry branches, eliciting a loud cracking sound."
    "可惜，你一抖，踩到了干树枝，发出清脆的断裂声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_d2e509be:

    # "Tetto puts down his sleeping brother silently, he knows the werewolves turned around."
    "特托默默放下沉睡的兄弟，他知道狼人已经转身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_914f704f:

    # "And he was right, they are approaching the source of the sound with no other way to escape."
    "他猜得没错。狼人正朝声音来源靠近，你们已经无路可逃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_6bbead98:

    # tt "{size=15}Prepare to fight, [e]. We need to make this quick.{/size}"
    tt "{size=15}准备战斗，[e]。我们得速战速决。{/size}"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_5d0fecf3:

    # "A black snout pokes from behind the tree, revealing the inquisitive dark werewolf."
    "一只黑色的鼻子从树后探出，露出那只好奇的黑狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_730d00a9:

    # ww "Ha, caught you."
    ww "哈，抓到你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_a91fa821:

    # ww2 "And his little accomplice."
    ww2 "还有你的小帮手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_5f8bb962:

    # "You have no way to escape now, being caught between the two werewolves."
    "你被两只狼人夹在中间，现在已经无处可逃。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Find_Cream_fc4c6e5a:

    # tt "W-well, let's get this over with."
    tt "好吧，那就让这一切快点结束吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Inquire_947f08fc:

    # e "Uffe, what do I need to do again?"
    e "乌菲，我还要做什么来着？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Inquire_230a3643:

    # "The werewolf leader gives you a side glance, and it's demeaning as usual."
    "狼人首领侧眼瞥了你一下，目光一如既往地轻蔑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Inquire_f796a9de:

    # u "Get to the Hollow on your map, clear shrubs. And retrieve the amulet."
    u "去地图上的空洞，清理灌木，然后把护符取回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Inquire_5ab1419f:

    # e "Uhm, where's the amulet?"
    e "呃，护符在哪里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Inquire_0a1a5eca:

    # u "I've assigned a fellow capable hunter where it lies, help him, and you'll get my amulet."
    u "我已经派了一位能干的猎人去护符所在的地方。帮助他，你就能拿到我的护符。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Territory_Quest_Inquire_fdac3ef9:

    # e "O-ok."
    e "好、好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_8b050d81:

    # u "What's the matter, trespasser." nointeract
    u "怎么了，擅闯者？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_6a84cd2c:

    # e "Why can't you just tell me about the stone?"
    e "你为什么不能直接告诉我石头的事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_6636979e:

    # u "Because nothing is free in this world, trespasser."
    u "因为这个世界上没有免费的东西，擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_c9047f46:

    # u "You do me this favor and I'll return one to you."
    u "你帮我一个忙，我也会回报你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_f957d574:

    # u "All's fair in the world."
    u "这个世界就是如此，公平得很。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_a4178901:

    # e "Alright. What do you need from me?"
    e "好吧。你需要我做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_c4fa4924:

    # u "To help me kill someone."
    u "帮我杀一个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_7e5be565:

    # e "What?"
    e "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_e18644f8:

    # u "Calm down. It's a creature who has been doing harm to the den."
    u "冷静点。那是一只一直在伤害巢穴的生物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_924d27d3:

    # e "What is it?"
    e "那是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_b1ef553c:

    # u "It's a werewolf who has gone feral."
    u "一只已经狂化的狼人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_6d7c8e3b:

    # e "What is this about a feral werewolf?"
    e "狂化狼人是怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_468a171d:

    # u "It's a curse that has struck our kind."
    u "这是降临在我们族群身上的诅咒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_46daab78:

    # u "One of us has been cursed and turned feral."
    u "我们之中有一个被诅咒，变成了狂兽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_a68b6e1f:

    # u "It will attack everything on sight."
    u "它会攻击视线内的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_cce6e2c3:

    # e "Why don't you send your pack after it if it's so dangerous?"
    e "既然它那么危险，你为什么不派你的族群去对付它？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_af5fe6be:

    # u "The pack can't afford to be affected by its curse."
    u "我们承担不起被它的诅咒影响的代价。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_c58f3d89:

    # u "And they're not feeble enough to squeeze through the cave."
    u "而且他们也没虚弱到能挤进那座洞窟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_c4ada693:

    # u "You need to pull your weight, trespasser if you wish to know more about the stone."
    u "想知道更多关于石头的事，你就得出力，擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_ead2970e:

    # u "You should be able to find the beast hiding in the cavern."
    u "你应该能在洞窟里找到那头野兽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_4f348d7b:

    # e "Fine. Any advice to deal with the feral werewolf?"
    e "好吧。对付那头狂化狼人有什么建议吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_ff667d13:

    # u "Don't die."
    u "别死。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_9aa3fed7:

    # u "To ensure that you are not just shitting me, I will need some proof."
    u "为了确保你不是在糊弄我，我需要一些证据。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_8f3581e1:

    # e "What else do you need me to do?"
    e "你还需要我做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_c0228ec4:

    # u "Fetch me the feral's nipple rings."
    u "把那头狂兽的乳环带给我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_6e0076b1:

    # e "Nipple rings?"
    e "乳环？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_3edde9fe:

    # u "Yes."
    u "没错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_01551c47:

    # "The alpha works his pec."
    "首领揉了揉自己的胸肌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_07e578d0:

    # u "Similar to these."
    u "和这些差不多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_f9386415:

    # "You have to admit. It's quite sexy on him."
    "你不得不承认，戴在他身上确实很性感。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_5063674a:

    # u "Bring me them and I'll tell you more about the stone."
    u "把它们带给我，我就会告诉你更多石头的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_85a398b8:

    # u "Hello again, Trespasser."
    u "又见面了，擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_7856d863:

    # e "...Hello Uffe."
    e "……你好，乌菲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_55d73718:

    # "Uffe's eyes widen, and his mouth twists in a predatory grin."
    "乌菲睁大了眼睛，嘴角扭曲成捕食者般的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_4ef39dc5:

    # u "I smell his scent on you."
    u "我闻到他身上的气味了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_029e606b:

    # u "You have killed the feral then."
    u "所以你已经杀了那头狂兽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_90d8f76d:

    # "His body language shows pure, unadulterated greed."
    "他的肢体语言流露出纯粹而毫不掩饰的贪婪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_0e38b8a0:

    # e "Yes. I have."
    e "是的……我杀了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_3f045fa3:

    # e "The cave he was in collapsed on top of him."
    e "他所在的洞窟塌在了他身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_0e4ed98d:

    # u "Excellent! You have done well little trespasser."
    u "太好了！你做得不错，小擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_0078ef74:

    # u "Now, hand over the nipple rings."
    u "现在，把乳环交给我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_06c176dd:

    # "You quickly fumble with your belongings until you pull out the rings."
    "你手忙脚乱地翻找随身物品，终于拿出了那些乳环。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_96210030:

    # u "I have been waiting a long time for that thing to be dead."
    u "我等那东西死掉已经很久了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_3b666d31:

    # u "This calls for a celebration."
    u "这值得庆祝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_60fda58a:

    # "Uffe turns to leave, but you stop him."
    "乌菲转身要走，但你叫住了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_3c813b28:

    # e "Uffe, what about our deal?"
    e "乌菲，我们的交易呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_0cca94b7:

    # "He turns back around, confused."
    "他困惑地转过身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_14b6b5e2:

    # e "The one where you tell me about the stone in return for me killing the feral?"
    e "就是你告诉我石头的事，作为我杀掉那头狂兽的回报的那笔交易？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_175677df:

    # u "Oh, yes, our deal."
    u "哦，对，我们的交易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_6283ab45:

    # "Uffe puts on a look of feigned innocence."
    "乌菲摆出一副假装无辜的表情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_d184118b:

    # u "The stone isn't ours."
    u "石头不是我们的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_67222726:

    # "He once more turns to leave."
    "他再次转身要走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_a7b73f23:

    # e "Wait, what?"
    e "等等，什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_5f3f9028:

    # e "Where are you going?!"
    e "你要去哪儿？！"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_2c507bdf:

    # u "To plan the celebration. Much meat needs to be hunted, and ground cleared for breeding."
    u "去筹划庆典。要猎很多肉，还要清出繁殖的场地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_6ab82ffc:

    # "You are too angry to process that last bit at this point."
    "你气得根本无心理解他最后那句话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_bcedc531:

    # e "What the fuck?!"
    e "搞什么鬼？！"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_7841847c:

    # e "I thought we had a deal!"
    e "我以为我们达成交易了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_9a6b31ff:

    # "Uffe turns to look at you, a devious look on his face."
    "乌菲转过头看你，脸上带着狡黠的神情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_d4ac1958:

    # u "We did."
    u "我们确实达成了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_2e34e55d:

    # u "I told you more about the stone, didn't I?"
    u "我不是把更多关于石头的事告诉你了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_8ba79fbe:

    # "Uffe leaves you alone with that."
    "乌菲丢下这句话，留下你独自站在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_f9562918:

    # "You stand there, frozen, for longer than you know."
    "你站在那里僵了很久，久到连自己都不知道过了多久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_d340e3b6:

    # "You only snap back to reality when a werewolf bumps into you."
    "直到一只狼人撞到你，你才猛然回过神来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_77d44554:

    # "You killed somebody for him."
    "你为了他杀了一个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_e065f3d1:

    # "You killed somebody for him, and he spits on your face as he did their life."
    "你为了他杀了一个人，而他却像践踏那个人的生命一样，朝你脸上吐了口唾沫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_98a6dd88:

    # "What have you done..."
    "你都做了些什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_85a398b8_1:

    # u "Hello again, Trespasser."
    u "又见面了，擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_7856d863_1:

    # e "...Hello Uffe."
    e "……你好，乌菲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_55d73718_1:

    # "Uffe's eyes widen, and his mouth twists in a predatory grin."
    "乌菲睁大眼睛，嘴角扭曲成捕食者般的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_289767b5:

    # u "I smell the nipple rings on you."
    u "我闻到你身上的乳环了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_029e606b_1:

    # u "You have killed the feral then."
    u "所以你已经杀了那头狂兽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_90d8f76d_1:

    # "His body language shows pure, unadulterated greed."
    "他的肢体语言流露出纯粹而毫不掩饰的贪婪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_a45d2a6d:

    # e "Yes... I have."
    e "是的……我杀了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_3f045fa3_1:

    # e "The cave he was in collapsed on top of him."
    e "他所在的洞窟塌在了他身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_0e4ed98d_1:

    # u "Excellent! You have done well little trespasser."
    u "太好了！你做得不错，小擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_399c893b:

    # "Your terrible attempt at lying goes completely unnoticed as he is utterly enraptured by the knowledge of the feral's death."
    "你糟糕的谎言完全没有引起他的注意，因为他已被狂兽死亡的消息彻底迷住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_c000ed5e:

    # "It's to the point where you can see saliva dripping from the corner of his mouth."
    "甚至能看见唾液从他嘴角滴落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_0078ef74_1:

    # u "Now, hand over the nipple rings."
    u "现在，把乳环交给我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_06c176dd_1:

    # "You quickly fumble with your belongings until you pull out the rings."
    "你手忙脚乱地翻找随身物品，终于拿出了那些乳环。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_96210030_1:

    # u "I have been waiting a long time for that thing to be dead."
    u "我等那东西死掉已经很久了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_3b666d31_1:

    # u "This calls for a celebration."
    u "这值得庆祝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_60fda58a_1:

    # "Uffe turns to leave, but you stop him."
    "乌菲转身要走，但你叫住了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_3c813b28_1:

    # e "Uffe, what about our deal?"
    e "乌菲，我们的交易呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_0cca94b7_1:

    # "He turns back around, confused."
    "他困惑地转过身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_14b6b5e2_1:

    # e "The one where you tell me about the stone in return for me killing the feral?"
    e "就是你告诉我石头的事，作为我杀掉那头狂兽的回报的那笔交易？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_9e8354ae:

    # "You did cheat your part of the bargain, but... he doesn't need to know that."
    "你确实在交易中耍了花招，不过……他没必要知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_175677df_1:

    # u "Oh, yes, our deal."
    u "哦，对，我们的交易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_6283ab45_1:

    # "Uffe puts on a look of feigned innocence."
    "乌菲摆出一副假装无辜的表情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_d184118b_1:

    # u "The stone isn't ours."
    u "石头不是我们的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_67222726_1:

    # "He once more turns to leave."
    "他再次转身要走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_a7b73f23_1:

    # e "Wait, what?"
    e "等等，什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_5f3f9028_1:

    # e "Where are you going?!"
    e "你要去哪儿？！"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_2c507bdf_1:

    # u "To plan the celebration. Much meat needs to be hunted, and ground cleared for breeding."
    u "去筹划庆典。要猎很多肉，还要清出繁殖的场地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_6ab82ffc_1:

    # "You are too angry to process that last bit at this point."
    "你气得根本无心理解他最后那句话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_bcedc531_1:

    # e "What the fuck?!"
    e "搞什么鬼？！"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_7841847c_1:

    # e "I thought we had a deal!"
    e "我以为我们达成交易了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_9a6b31ff_1:

    # "Uffe turns to look at you, a devious look on his face."
    "乌菲转过头看你，脸上带着狡黠的神情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_d4ac1958_1:

    # u "We did."
    u "我们确实达成了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_2e34e55d_1:

    # u "I told you more about the stone, didn't I?"
    u "我不是把更多关于石头的事告诉你了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_8ba79fbe_1:

    # "Uffe leaves you alone with that."
    "乌菲丢下这句话，留下你独自站在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_f9562918_1:

    # "You stand there, frozen, for longer than you know."
    "你站在那里僵了很久，久到连自己都不知道过了多久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_d340e3b6_1:

    # "You only snap back to reality when a werewolf bumps into you."
    "直到一只狼人撞到你，你才猛然回过神来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_0fd25cee:

    # "While it might be hypocritical to feel betrayed by his taking advantage of a loophole in the bargain, you can't help but feel spit on."
    "虽然因为他钻交易的漏洞而感到背叛有些虚伪，但你还是无法抑制被他羞辱的感觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_4a7e1662:

    # "And perhaps feel the inkling of a desire for revenge blossoming in your bosom."
    "也许，你胸中还开始萌生出一丝复仇的欲望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_76f3aebc:

    # "You received 150 gold."
    "你获得了150枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_bb84d61d:

    # e "How is life in the dark forest?"
    e "黑暗森林里的生活怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_d415b5d1:

    # u "Life is hard. We stick to ourselves and the world leave us be."
    u "生活很艰难。我们只顾自己，外面的世界也不来打扰我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_1594d465:

    # u "That's why your presence here is disconcerting, trespasser."
    u "所以你的出现让人很不安，擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_77419ba8:

    # "He glares at you."
    "他瞪着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_8c753ff9:

    # e "What about the raids on the nearby goat tribe?"
    e "附近的山羊族遭到袭击一事呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_6151e1b0:

    # "The glare intensifies."
    "他的目光变得更加凌厉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_c3464a25:

    # u "I don't control the whole pack, trespasser. What they do outside the dark forest is beyond my control."
    u "我控制不了整个族群，擅闯者。他们在黑暗森林外做什么，不是我能管的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_4ada723e:

    # "You have a feeling he's irked that you bring up this topic."
    "你感觉他对你提起这个话题很恼火。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_d2e6df45:

    # e "How did you become the alpha?"
    e "你是怎么成为首领的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_bed76002:

    # "The werewolf grins proudly."
    "狼人得意地咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_52917f3a:

    # u "The strongest always come out on top. The weaker ones are exiled or banished."
    u "最强者总会胜出。弱者则会被驱逐或放逐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_1589cbb4:

    # u "There can only be one alpha."
    u "首领只能有一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_7b7b6853:

    # u "It's kill or be killed, trespasser."
    u "不是杀人，就是被杀，擅闯者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_b69a68ff:

    # e "Can you get the werewolves to stop attacking me as I travel through the forest?"
    e "你能让狼人别在我穿过森林时攻击我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_1c2cf3f4:

    # u "No."
    u "不行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_1ea97b2d:

    # e "Why?"
    e "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_b39e9808:

    # u "Because no."
    u "因为不行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_16f4c191:

    # u "Plus, if you can't handle a normal werewolf, you are of no help to me anyway."
    u "再说，如果连普通狼人你都对付不了，那你对我也没有任何用处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_6acf43f0:

    # e "That's all, thank you U-"
    e "就这些了，谢谢你，乌——"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_687e3b38:

    # e "Alpha."
    e "首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite Uffe_Normal_Talk_b260f100:

    # u "Good."
    u "很好。"
